# headwear/helm/nasal: the Nasal helm: a steel cap to the brows, a brass-riveted rim, the nasal bar down the nose; hair above the rim hidden
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; armour and helms to P2c's ARMOUR / HELMS). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# Regions (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD; contracts 3b) mark the rim band R, its socket G and the brow band P; pixels unchanged.
# (polish i1, gen_nasal.py) the rim's underside in metal 1 (never the outline step) and a 1 px nasal facing down: the
# blind panel read the old dark rim and 3 px bar as goggles in game
use person
body adult
role helm form1
role helm band2
role helm fam.cone
layer headwear
anchor head
keys rest
tags overlay

# (P5b SIG FR1) begin imperial-cap2: the Imperial T2 Montefortino: the hinged cheek guards, the neck guard
legend ! metal2 0
legend $ metal2 1
legend % metal2 2
legend & metal2 3
view D key rest origin 0 -4 when sighelm-imperial,!helm.t3,helm.t2
|!..............!
|!..............!
|!&............$!
|&%............%$
|&%............%$
|&%............%$
|!$............$!
view U key rest origin 0 -5 when sighelm-imperial,!helm.t3,helm.t2
|!&&&&&&&&&&&&&&!
|.!!!!!!!!!!!!!!.
view R key rest origin 0 -5 when sighelm-imperial,!helm.t3,helm.t2
|&&!.........
|!.........&!
|..........%%
|..........%$
|..........%$
|..........$!
view L key rest origin -4 -5 when sighelm-imperial,!helm.t3,helm.t2
|.........!$$
|!$.........!
|%%..........
|&%..........
|&%..........
|!&..........
# (P5b SIG FR1) end imperial-cap2
